            <div xml:id="d84-a2">

                <pb facs="0868" n="858" xml:id="pg858"/>

                <head>Appendix II</head>
                <p rendition="#center">[<hi rendition="#italic">Resolution by the Council of the
                        Principal Allied and Associated Powers</hi>]</p>
                <p>The Council of the Principal Allied and Associated Powers have considered the
                    attached letter from M. Fromageot and have agreed that the following words
                    “during the period of the belligerency of each as an Allied and Associated Power
                    against Germany”, which had been omitted from the French text but retained in
                    the English text of Article 232 of the Treaty of Peace with Germany, should be
                    re-instated in the French text.</p>
                <closer><signed>
                        <list>
                            <item>G. C.</item>
                            <item>W. W.</item>
                            <item>D. Ll. G.</item>
                            <item>V. O.</item>
                        </list>
                    </signed>
                    <lb/><dateline rendition="#float-left">
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1919-05-20">20 <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >May</hi>, 1919</date>.</dateline>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
